cross live servers to collect real-time data on robberies, inventories, player stats, and more. We then display it all through a fast, easy-to-use web interface.\"},{q:\"Is Muffin Hook free to use?\",a:\"Yes! All core features are completely free. We offer a Patreon for supporters who want to help keep the bots running and get early access to new tools.\"},{q:\"How does Robbery Sniping work?\",a:\"Our bots monitor hundreds of Jailbreak servers and report which robberies are open or in progress. You can filter by robbery type and join a server directly with one click.\"},{q:\"How accurate is the data?\",a:\"Data refreshes every few seconds. Each card shows exactly how long ago it was last updated so you always know how fresh the information is.\"},{q:\"Is this allowed by Jailbreak?\",a:\"According to the jailbreak devs, MuffinHook is NOT bannable.\"},{q:\"How do I report a bug or suggest a feature?\",a:\"Join our Discord server! We actively take feedback and ship improvements based on what the community asks for.\"}];return d.jsxs(\"div\",{className:\"min-h-screen bg-background\",children:[d.jsxs(\"section\",{className:\"relative overflow-hidden border-b border-border py-24 md:py-32\",children:[d.jsx(\"div\",{className:\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-primary/8 via-accent/5 to-primary/3 animate-gradient-shift\"}),d.jsx(\"div\",{className:\"absolute inset-0 bg-[radial-gradient(ellipse_at_top_right,hsl(217_91%_60%/0.08),transparent_50%)]\"}),d.jsxs(\"div\",{className:\"container mx-auto px-4 text-center max-w-3xl relative z-10\",children:[d.jsx(\"img\",{src:\"/extraImages/jailbreaklogo.png\",alt:\"Jailbreak Logo\",className:\"w-20 h-20 mx-auto mb-6 animate-float drop-shadow-lg object-contain\"}),d.jsx(\"h1\",{className:\"text-5xl md:text-7xl font-extrabold mb-3 bg-gradient-primary bg-clip-text text-transparent tracking-tight\",children:\"Muffin Hook\"}),d.jsx(\"p\",{className:\"text-lg text-muted-foreground mb-8 max-w-xl mx-auto\",children:\"The ultimate intel